area: config
case: 01-empty
verification: explicit-divergence
oracle: python
projection: config
reason: the port has one extraction backend, so its default fetch.extractor is "stdlib"; the oracle's default is "trafilatura", a library this tree carries but the port has not wrapped. A P6 port decision, not a silent drift: the port refuses any other name and the oracle refuses names outside its two.
